{"product":{"id":7345075060789,"title":"Old Style FDF Raceshop Classic Hoodie","body_html":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eEmbrace the sleek sophistication of our latest hoodie, tailored for the modern minimalist. Crafted with premium, soft-touch fabric that ensures durability and comfort, this hoodie is designed to keep up with your dynamic lifestyle. The clean, uncomplicated design features a subtly embossed 'FDF Raceshop' logo. Whether you're out for a casual drive or meeting friends, this hoodie promises to be your go-to for effortless cool.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial: \u003c\/strong\u003e100% premium combed ring spun cotton with double Fleeced lined hood and a classic flat drawcord.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStitching: \u003c\/strong\u003eDouble stitched throughout.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect for motorsport enthusiasts and racing fans alike. Elevate your motorsport wardrobe with this essential piece and wear your passion for racing with pride.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLimited Quantities Available – Order Yours Today!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose FDF?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDriver-inspired designs\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e:\u003c\/strong\u003e Our products feature innovative, driver-inspired designs tailored for performance and style.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-quality materials\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e:\u003c\/strong\u003e We use only high-strength alloys to ensure the durability and superior quality of our products.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMade in North America\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e:\u003c\/strong\u003e Our products are proudly made in-house in North America, ensuring exceptional craftsmanship and reliability.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","vendor":"FDFRaceshop","product_type":"Merchandise","created_at":"2024-01-25T10:39:05-05:00","handle":"fdf-raceshop-classic-hoodie","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:30-04:00","published_at":"2026-10-20T13:18:41-04:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"apparel, catalog-main, merch, new","variants":[{"id":42914656944181,"product_id":7345075060789,"title":"Small","price":"47.27","sku":"FDF-HOOD-CLSC-BL-SM","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Small","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2024-01-25T11:52:40-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:30-04:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":907,"image_id":null,"weight":2.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":42914656976949,"product_id":7345075060789,"title":"Medium","price":"47.27","sku":"FDF-HOOD-CLSC-BL-MD","position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Medium","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2024-01-25T11:52:40-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:30-04:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":907,"image_id":null,"weight":2.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_